 "card_notes": [
  {
   "text": "- Context Length: 262,144 natively",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L64"
  },
  {
   "text": "<tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);background:rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1)\">Instruct (Non-Thinking) Mode</td></tr>",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L75"
  },
  {
   "text": "* Experimental settings: top_p=0.95, top_k=20, presence_penalty=1.5, and temperature=1.0 were used.<br>",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L286"
  },
  {
   "text": "*  Scores of Qwen3.5 models are reported as Thinking / Non-thinking.<br>",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L575"
  },
  {
   "text": "* Experimental settings: For the Video benchmarks, we used top_p=0.95, top_k=20, presence_penalty=1.5, and temperature=1.0. All other benchmarks adopted the same hyperparameter configuration but with temperature=0.6 under the thinking mode. Under the no-thinking mode, the inference hyperparameters w",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L577"
  },
  {
   "text": "> Qwen3.5 models support both non-thinking and thinking mode. **Qwen3.5-2B operates in non-thinking mode by default**.",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L585"
  },
  {
   "text": "> The model has a default context length of 262,144 tokens.",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L601"
  },
  {
   "text": "- **Standard Version**: The following command can be used to create an API endpoint with maximum context length 262,144 tokens using tensor parallel on 8 GPUs.",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L615"
  },
  {
   "text": "- **Standard Version**: The following command can be used to create an API endpoint with maximum context length 262,144 tokens using tensor parallel on 8 GPUs.",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L646"
  },
  {
   "text": "> - Non-thinking mode for text tasks: `temperature=1.0, top_p=1.00, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=2.0, repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L705"
  },
  {
   "text": "> - Non-thinking mode for VL tasks: `temperature=0.7, top_p=0.80, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=1.5, repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L706"
  },
  {
   "text": "> - Thinking mode for text tasks: `temperature=1.0, top_p=0.95, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=1.5, repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L707"
  },
  {
   "text": "> - Thinking mode for VL or precise coding (e.g. WebDev) tasks : `temperature=0.6, top_p=0.95, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L708"
  },
  {
   "text": "#### Thinking Mode",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L823"
  },
  {
   "text": "> Qwen3.5 does not officially support the soft switch of Qwen3, i.e., `/think` and `/nothink`.",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L826"
  },
  {
   "text": "> In thinking mode, we have observed that when using the recommended sampling parameters, Qwen3.5-2B is more prone to entering thinking loops compared to other Qwen3.5 models, which may prevent it from terminating generation properly.",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L893"
  },
  {
   "text": "- **Non-thinking mode for text tasks**:",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L968"
  },
  {
   "text": "`temperature=1.0`, `top_p=1.00`, `top_k=20`, `min_p=0.0`, `presence_penalty=2.0`, `repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L969"
  },
  {
   "text": "- **Non-thinking mode for VL tasks**:",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L970"
  },
  {
   "text": "`temperature=0.7`, `top_p=0.80`, `top_k=20`, `min_p=0.0`, `presence_penalty=1.5`, `repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B README.md:L971"
  },
  {
   "text": "- Context Length: 262,144 natively",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L90"
  },
  {
   "text": "<tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);background:rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1)\">Instruct (Non-Thinking) Mode</td></tr>",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L101"
  },
  {
   "text": "* Experimental settings: top_p=0.95, top_k=20, presence_penalty=1.5, and temperature=1.0 were used.<br>",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L312"
  },
  {
   "text": "*  Scores of Qwen3.5 models are reported as Thinking / Non-thinking.<br>",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L601"
  },
  {
   "text": "* Experimental settings: For the Video benchmarks, we used top_p=0.95, top_k=20, presence_penalty=1.5, and temperature=1.0. All other benchmarks adopted the same hyperparameter configuration but with temperature=0.6 under the thinking mode. Under the no-thinking mode, the inference hyperparameters w",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L603"
  },
  {
   "text": "> Qwen3.5 models support both non-thinking and thinking mode. **Qwen3.5-2B operates in non-thinking mode by default**.",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L611"
  },
  {
   "text": "> The model has a default context length of 262,144 tokens.",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L627"
  },
  {
   "text": "- **Standard Version**: The following command can be used to create an API endpoint with maximum context length 262,144 tokens using tensor parallel on 8 GPUs.",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L641"
  },
  {
   "text": "- **Standard Version**: The following command can be used to create an API endpoint with maximum context length 262,144 tokens using tensor parallel on 8 GPUs.",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L672"
  },
  {
   "text": "> - Non-thinking mode for text tasks: `temperature=1.0, top_p=1.00, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=2.0, repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF README.md:L731"
  }
